      "text": "Both baseline replays and both Nsight Systems traced reply streams match v1 exactly. Both Nsight Compute attempts were unsupported with ERR_NVGPUCTRPERM and map to completed failed processes, retaining native status/exit3. No hardware counters are invented. The capability probe independently ran/checked its control kernel and confirmed the same counter-permission restriction. The Nsight manifest hashes the bash launch wrapper; actual GPU service SHA is in instruments.sha256 and the arm identities."
